invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.c
catches: webpki_resume_test
reason: a received ticket's binding is computed over its own PSK in place of
  the session's configuration hash, so the binding names no hostname
  and no ticket the session receives can be presented again. The
  received-ticket rows object.

--- old
    webpki_ticket_binding(ticket.psk, t->ticket_config_hash, ticket.binding);
--- new
    webpki_ticket_binding(ticket.psk, ticket.psk, ticket.binding);
